* *Shoshinki* (1543), *Miyasegawa*
* *Jingi Shiryō*, Shibunkaku – Kurita Hiroshi, *Nakatahama Shrine*, *Miyasegawa*
* *Kofudoki Itsubun Kōshō*, Arimine Shoten – Kurita Hiroshi, *Nakatahama Shrine*, *Miyasegawa*
* *Ancient Historical Geography Studies*, Sanyōdō / Bitchū Province / Miyasegawa, Sanseidō – Inoue Michiyasu, *Miyasegawa*
* *Kibi District History*, Meicho Publishing – Nagayama Usaburō, *Nakatahama Shrine*
* *Detailed Records of 22 Shrines* (1874, Meiji 7), Okayama Prefecture Shrine and Temple Bureau, *Nakatahama Shrine*, *Miyasegawa*
