* *Kibi Corridor* (Published in *Sanyō Shimbun*, April 14, 1996), Sanyō Shimbun, *Miyasegawa*

== Access==
* **Rail:** Approximately 10 minutes on foot north from [[JR West Japan|JR West]] [[Momotarō Line]] ([[Kibi Line]]) at [[Higashi-Sōja Station]].

