{{ill|Moto-Ise Shrines|ja|元伊勢|1=Moto-Ise Shrines|12=draft}} are [[Shinto shrines]] that used to host Amaterasu before she was moved to [[Ise Jingu]].<ref>{{Cite book |last=Ki'''{{subst:PAGENAME}}'''

