== Access==
* **Rail:** Approximately 10 minutes on foot north from [[JR West Japan|JR West]] [[Momotarō Line]] ([[:en:Kibi Line|Kibi Line]]) at [[:en:Higashi-Sōja Station|Higashi-Sōja Station]].

